{"id":"b038ed0e07ed","path":"/en/education","lang":"en","title":"Education","description":"USI offers Bachelor's and Master's Degrees, Doctoral Studies, and Lifelong Leaning in several fields. Discover now our educational offer.","section":"Education","crumbs":[],"image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/orientamento-img_1469.jpg?itok=Lt2du9wz","words":94,"alternates":{"it":"/it/formazione","en":"/en/education"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"Education","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p><strong>USI offers 9 Bachelor's degrees (undergraduate programmes), 28 Master's degrees (graduate programmes), and several Doctoral, Continuing Education, and Summer / Winter School programmes.</strong></p> <p>USI offers a learning experience tailored to each student. With a ratio of <strong>1 lecturer for every 7 students</strong>, offer the opportunity to engage in <strong>genuine, direct, and open dialogue</strong> with professors.</p> <p>Students have the opportunity not to be just a number and to <strong>develop their potential and individuality</strong>, on a journey filled with curiosity and feeding their desire to achieve and experiment.</p>"},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"Studying at Università della Svizzera italiana"},{"t":"cards","items":[{"title":"Why USI","href":"/en/education/why-usi","image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/orientamento-img_1469.jpg?itok=Lt2du9wz"},{"title":"Bachelor","href":"/en/education/bachelor","image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/orientamento-0p8a3011.jpg?itok=4P6Ll08e"},{"title":"Master","href":"/en/education/master","image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/orientamento-0p8a3772.jpg?itok=MhicjoXY"},{"title":"Doctoral studies","href":"/en/education/doctoral-studies","image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/orientamento-dottorato.jpg?itok=NsOYublM"},{"title":"Continuing Education","href":"/en/originalnode/42875","image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/orientamento-lll-lifelong-learning-formazione-continua-apprendimento-permanente-02.jpg?itok=ntPOMJzR"},{"title":"Summer / Winter Schools","href":"/en/originalnode/16244","image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/press-summer-winter-school-piastrella-web.jpg?itok=Hatualfy"}]}],"ctas":[],"nav":[],"links":[{"label":"Study Advisory Service","href":"https://search.usi.ch/en/organisational-units/156/study-advisory-and-promotion-service"},{"label":"+41 58 666 4795","href":"tel:+41586664795"},{"label":"orientamento@usi.ch","href":"mailto:orientamento@usi.ch"},{"label":"Studying at USI (PDF 6.15 MB)","href":"/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/orientamento-usi_offerta_formativa.pdf"}],"source":"https://www.usi.ch/en/education","fetchedAt":"2026-10-08T17:21:07.374Z"}